DTSTART:20261021T115900Z
DTEND:20261021T125900Z
SUMMARY:[Biometrics & Human Sensing][Computer Vision & Pattern Recognition]
  FG 2027 - Workshop and tutorial proposal deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: IEEE International Conference on Automatic Fa
 ce and Gesture Recognition\nWebsite: https://fg2027.ieee-biometrics.org/\
 nSource URL: https://fg2027.ieee-biometrics.org/dates/\nLocation: Marrake
 sh\, Morocco\nTopics: Biometrics & Human Sensing\, Computer Vision & Patt
 ern Recognition\, Deep Representation Learning\, Machine Learning\nSize: 
 M\nSubmission type: Long and short papers / face\, gesture\, and body rec
 ognition\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Of
 ficial CFP and dates page updated October 5 extend the abstract and paper
  deadlines to October 23 and 30\, replacing October 9 and 16. Cutoffs are
  AoE. Full event includes April 26/30 workshops\; main sessions are April
  27-29. CMT opening is announced for September 25 without an exact hour\;
  no portal-open observation is fabricated. M is an editorial estimate.\nS
 cope: Face\, gesture\, body movement\, and human behavior from images and
  video\, including detection\, tracking\, recognition\, facial expression
  and affect\, pose and action analysis\, and soft biometrics. Characteris
 tic methods include advanced visual learning\, generative modeling and ne
 ural rendering\, multimodal fusion\, and evaluation across demographic an
 d acquisition conditions. Bias\, interpretability\, and robust recognitio
 n are directly tied to human sensing rather than generic application tags
 .\nAdditional topics: Robustness & Safety\, Fairness & Responsible AI\, C
 omputer Graphics & Visualization\, Explainability & Interpretability\nSco
 pe sources (2027): https://fg2027.ieee-biometrics.org/call-for-papers/\nS
 cope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://fg2027.ieee-biometrics.org/dates/
END:VEVENT
