 tic methods include advanced visual learning\, generative modeling and ne
 ural rendering\, multimodal fusion\, and evaluation across demographic an
 d acquisition conditions. Bias\, interpretability\, and robust recognitio
 n are directly tied to human sensing rather than generic application tags
 .\nAdditional topics: Robustness & Safety\, Fairness & Responsible AI\, C
 omputer Graphics & Visualization\, Explainability & Interpretability\nSco
 pe sources (2027): https://fg2027.ieee-biometrics.org/call-for-papers/\nS
 cope last checked: 2026-10-07
